        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t3f" value="project.py holds PROJECT_ROOT and SETTINGS_FILE and has no classes.   stop() -&gt; taskkill /F /T on the whole tree.   The overrides file is unlinked when the child exits.   Launcher/main.py calls UI.theme.sharp_on_high_dpi() before creating LauncherApp." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
